        <mxCell id="v87" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#E3EEF9'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S1 Fatima&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; lifecycle, membership, locality, scheduler, keyword search&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#FDEBDD'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S2 Areeba&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; engine, reviews, meaning-based search and ranking, notifications, app&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#EEE5F6'&gt;&amp;nbsp;S3 Minahil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; moderation, audit, uploads, search logging, evaluation&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#F7F7F7;color:#999'&gt;&amp;nbsp;grey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; external or deferred &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='border:2px solid #0A7A36'&gt;&amp;nbsp;green border&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; new in iteration 2&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9675;&amp;#8212; provided interface &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; - - -&amp;gt; required interface. Module 4 uses ILenderEvidence, so ranking never computes trust itself and never shows a single number (FR-S-04)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1d1d1d;spacing=2;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1">
